{
  "_note": "中国国债收益率(财政部-中国国债收益率曲线,中央国债登记结算公司编制,收盘口径,两位小数)。一次取最近 50 个日历日;mode=ten 出 10 年 + 日变化 + 近 1 个月迷你线,mode=curve 出最新与约 1 个月前两条曲线 + 10−2 年利差。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "zh",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "语言:文案在取数层按语言出。切语言 = 整盘重取,数据缓存含 locale。没注入 @app 时按英文(overseas-first §2)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y0",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy)]"
      },
      "_note": "今年(按设备时区;跨年那几个小时差一天无妨:两年的文件都会取)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${y0}-1),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "去年。⚠️ 进 URL 的数字过 parseNumber(Android calc 返回 2025.0)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "modeIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${mode},ten)]"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删)。mode = ten(10 年)/ curve(曲线)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cs",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${nowMs}-4320000000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "起点 = 50 个日历日前:够 22 个交易日(春节 / 国庆长假也够),行数少服务端才快。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ce",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${nowMs}+86400000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "终点 = 明天:设备在西半球时「今天」比北京晚一天,不多给一天会漏掉最新一行(区间超出今天不报错,实测)。"
    },
    {
      "id": "cr",
      "action": "request",
      "params": {
        "url": "https://yield.chinabond.com.cn/cbweb-czb-web/czb/historyQuery?startDate=${cs}&endDate=${ce}&gjqx=0&locale=cn_ZH&qxmc=1",
        "method": "GET",
        "formatType": "json",
        "timeout": "10000"
      },
      "_note": "财政部-中国国债收益率曲线(中债编制),JSON(Content-Type 写的是 text/plain)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / concurrent 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(memory actionflow-concurrent-late-merge)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cd0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[0].workTime},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cok",
        "value": "$[if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${cd0},x),^20[0-9][0-9]-[0-9]+-[0-9]+$),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${cok},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "chinabond unavailable"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "拿不到最新一行(接口挂了 / 返回 heList:null)= 取数失败(G26),宿主贴上次成功的那帧。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at",
        "value": "$[if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${cd0},x),^[0-9]+-[0-9]+-[0-9]+$),subString::(${cd0},5,10),--)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${modeIn},ten),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv1",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[0].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv2",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[1].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv3",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[2].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv4",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[3].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv5",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[4].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv6",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[5].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv7",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[6].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv8",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[7].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv9",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[8].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv10",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[9].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv11",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[10].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv12",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[11].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv13",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[12].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv14",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[13].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv15",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[14].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv16",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[15].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv17",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[16].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv18",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[17].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv19",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[18].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv20",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[19].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv21",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[20].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tv22",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[21].tenYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "v2R",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[0].twoYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "v30R",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${cr.heList[0].thirtyYear},)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "v10",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tv1},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),parseNumber::(${tv1},0.00),)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "v2",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${v2R},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),parseNumber::(${v2R},0.00),)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "v30",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${v30R},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),parseNumber::(${v30R},0.00),)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${v10},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),0,1)]"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "error",
              "params": {
                "errorMsg": "chinabond 10y missing"
              }
            }
          ],
          "_note": "主数 10 年取不到 = 失败(G26)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "bpv",
            "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tv1},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tv2},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1)),round::(calc::((${tv1}-${tv2})*100)),)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "bpn",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bpv},__none__),__none__),0,1),1),parseNumber::(if::(ge::(${bpv},0),${bpv},calc::(0-${bpv})),0),)]"
          },
          "_note": "⚠️ 进文本的数字过 parseNumber(x,0):Android 上 round 返回 double,直接拼会渲成「4.0 基点」。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "bpt",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bpv},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),--,if::(eq::(${bpn},0),if::(eq::(${zh},1),持平,flat),if::(gt::(${bpv},0),if::(eq::(${zh},1),+${bpn} 基点,+${bpn} bp),if::(eq::(${zh},1),−${bpn} 基点,−${bpn} bp))))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "bpu",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bpv},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),n,if::(gt::(${bpv},0),1,0))]"
          },
          "_note": "方向:1 涨 / 0 跌 / n 无数(不留空:空键在 CLI 里报「字段为空」,且 rckit.col 对 n 同样走灰)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "bpf",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bpv},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),0,if::(eq::(${bpn},0),1,0))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "bps",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bpv},__none__),__none__),0,1),0),--,if::(eq::(${bpn},0),0,if::(gt::(${bpv},0),+${bpn},−${bpn})))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lLo",
            "value": "$[min::(findNotEmpty::(${tv22},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv21},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv20},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv19},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv18},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv17},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv16},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv15},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv14},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv13},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv12},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv11},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv10},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv9},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv8},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv7},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv6},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv5},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv4},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv3},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv2},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv1},${tv1}))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lHi",
            "value": "$[max::(findNotEmpty::(${tv22},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv21},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv20},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv19},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv18},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv17},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv16},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv15},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv14},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv13},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv12},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv11},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv10},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv9},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv8},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv7},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv6},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv5},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv4},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv3},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv2},${tv1}),findNotEmpty::(${tv1},${tv1}))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lOk",
            "value": "$[if::(and::(eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tv22},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1),eq::(if::(matches::(findNotEmpty::(${tv1},x),^-?[0-9]+[.]?[0-9]*$),1,0),1)),1,0)]"
          },
          "_note": "线画不画:凑得满 22 个收盘(平线也画:一个月没动本身就是信息)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lRg",
            "value": "$[max::(0.1,calc::(${lHi}-${lLo}))]"
          },
          "_note": "纵向量程至少 10 个基点:中国国债只有两位小数、一个月常常只动 1–3 个基点,按极差铺满会把 1 个基点画成满幅跳动。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lTop",
            "value": "$[calc::((${lHi}+${lLo})/2+${lRg}/2)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y0",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv22},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y1",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv21},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y2",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv20},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y3",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv19},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y4",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv18},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y5",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv17},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y6",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv16},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y7",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv15},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y8",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv14},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y9",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv13},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y10",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv12},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y11",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv11},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y12",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv10},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y13",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv9},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y14",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv8},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y15",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv7},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y16",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv6},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y17",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv5},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y18",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv4},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y19",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv3},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y20",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv2},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21y21",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${lOk},1),parseNumber::(calc::(2+(${lTop}-findNotEmpty::(${tv1},${tv1}))/${lRg}*22),0.0),13)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "l21P",
            "value": "2.0,${l21y0},4.5,${l21y1},7.0,${l21y2},9.4,${l21y3},11.9,${l21y4},14.4,${l21y5},16.9,${l21y6},19.3,${l21y7},21.8,${l21y8},24.3,${l21y9},26.8,${l21y10},29.2,${l21y11},31.7,${l21y12},34.2,${l21y13},36.7,${l21y14},39.1,${l21y15},41.6,${l21y16},44.1,${l21y17},46.6,${l21y18},49.0,${l21y19},51.5,${l21y20},54.0,${l21y21}"
          }
        },
        {
